        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 1502, Single Cylinder Interconnected Woodward Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Weslock made Woodward Unigard Features a simple traditional shape that makes it a great choice for classically styled homes. The Interconnected Single Cylinder Handleset allows you to simply turn your interior lever or knob to open your door without having to unlock the deadbolt. Good for doors with backset of 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplates. It is adjustable door thicknesses for 1-1/2\" to 2\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Woodward Unigard Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5-pin cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass exterior.</li>\r\n<li>1 inch throw deadbolt with two hardened steel rollers.</li>\r\n<li>Fits doors prepared with 2-1/8\" top and 2-1/8\" bottom cross holes and 1\" edge hole.</li>\r\n<li>Panic proof - one turn of the interior knob/lever unlocks and opens the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Interconnected Woodward Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 6-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 6-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Cross Hole Spacing:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Edge Hole Spacing:  2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplates</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjusts from 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior. From the interior, the deadbolt is thrown by a thumbturn while the interior lever or knob opens the door without having to unlock the deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Interconnected Unigard Woodward Handleset, Weslock 1502",
                "description": "Weslock 1502, Single Cylinder Interconnected Woodward Handleset - The Weslock made Woodward Unidard Features a simple traditional shape that makes it a great choice for classically styled homes. The Interconnected Single Cylinder Handleset allows you to simply turn your interior lever or knob to open your door without having to unlock the deadbolt. Good for doors with backset of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches with removable faceplates. It is adjustable door thicknesses for 1-1/2 inches to 2 inches.\r\n",
                "keywords": "weslock 1502 Unigard Rectangle, wes-1502, interconnect collection weslock, Rectangle shaped handlesets, unigard handlesets, Rectangle entry sets, Rectangle weslock handlests, Single Cylinder Interconnected Unigard Woodward Handlesets, Woodward Unigard Handlseset With Interconnects, Woodward handlesets,"
